Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling, Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,on the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,cobalt blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The clouds float above the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanging out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,just me and you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our time is now and soon you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile with all your heart as you go\Npast the problems that await you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hopes alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Never look down upon yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just cast a magic spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You will get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.74,0:00:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Star twinkle twinkle rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fast beats premonitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.86,0:00:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the colors from\Nall the rainbow beams!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Star come with me and we'll go far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just fallen angels!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shooting arrows into our hopeful dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.44,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.68,0:01:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy Crazy Rainbow Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Twinkle Twinkle Rainbow Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Within the cobalt blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven colors will come to our surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy Crazy Rainbow Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.54,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Twinkle Twinkle Rainbow Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon all your worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your troubles show through\Nthe mirror of your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me comfort you, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold your time within my glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We sure are fallen angels!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just singing our hearts\Nall out from up above!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dying, dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy, hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a crazy, hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.04,0:02:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy, hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a crazy, hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.40,0:02:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then, just to make sure\Nwe're all on the same page about Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about doing what's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been depressed for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.63,0:02:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is mine the only one with a drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about the picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a photo\Nuntil you said something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a handsome face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All the women in the world\Nare gonna laugh at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.30,0:03:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he was a reporter\Nfor the local paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a bounty kind of stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But on the upside, the picture\Nturned out pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I fought like a true man back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate just like\Nall the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do they mean by pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a doctor, darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, try harder then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to see your ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't keep our big bro waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.52,0:03:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope we're not\Nforgetting anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get Franky in our\Nnew ship, we're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji's not moving anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we'll just have to find a new cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a minute, Darren!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, pirate lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you stay a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is certainly an unusual case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.98,0:03:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There may not be many of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but every member of their crew\Nhas a bounty on their head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.34,0:03:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're worth over 600\Nmillion total. Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.72,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was wondering what about\Nthis black-legged character?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there no photo of him?\NI well I assure you, sir I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.40,0:04:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,did take one but look at what\Nhappened when I developed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the film it's quite unsettling\Nthe photo is completely black
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,did you by any chance forget\Nto take off the lens cap
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro, we brought the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,big bro where are you they're here i see
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.16,0:04:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,something big you think\Nthat's it hey Franky we're
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for our ship now? Oh\Nhey, Iceburg, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,good to see you yeah you\Ntoo but where's Franky
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.38,0:04:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,unfortunately Franky can't be here\Nat the moment but the ship is indeed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,complete shall we take a look uh-huh i\Nthink you're going to be impressed i was
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,floored simply looking at the blueprints\Nthis ship can sail any scene it may
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,take you to the end of the Grand Line\Nafter all just let me You see it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a message that Franky asked\Nme to pass on to you, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.78,0:05:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He said that if you're going to\Nbe the king of pirates someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,then your ship should\Nbe the king of beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing! Say that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! How lovely! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.86,0:05:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's super big and super cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks ready to break, Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's really free?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.99,0:05:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got to be twice as big as Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.86,0:05:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is the sail a sloop?\NIt's huge! Show me the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, I want to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I love the figurehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of flower is it supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I think he intended\Nit to be a loyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The inside is awesome, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The deck has a lawn and so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:05:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be nice to do\Nsome gardening up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for a nap, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, where's the kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.74,0:06:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have great mobility\Nwith a gaff sail of that size.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they call this kind\Nof ship a brigantine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Brigantine ships are square-rigged in the\Nfront and have a gaff sail in the back,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,like a sloop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.97,0:06:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They're quite versatile if the\Nnavigator's up to the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to check out the interior!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.78,0:06:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got a fridge with a lock,\Njust like I always wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.68,0:06:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at this oven!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.18,0:06:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're the best, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You made all my dreams come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ice Pops, this is cool and\Nall, but where did Franky go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta thank him for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but it would appear\Nthat he doesn't want to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, you were going to invite\NFranky to be your shipwright, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't have it any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, this is his ship, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He has to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.40,0:06:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that might be your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean he doesn't want to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, if you invited him,\Nhe wouldn't be able to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.58,0:07:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he's hiding right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what I'm saying is that he\Nwants to join you in his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you can probably\Nsee that for yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,looking at all the love and care\Nhe put into building this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an aquarium in here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's quite fond of your crew, so\Nplease don't blame yourself for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But he believes it's his\Nduty to stay on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His bond has become the\Nchain that binds him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.02,0:07:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Though if you ask me, I think he's\Nbeing needlessly stubborn over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, that's how he feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So trying to reason with him\Nwould be a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want him to go with you,\Nthen your only choice is to use Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.10,0:07:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he's not willing to break that\Nchain, you'll have to do it for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.10,0:07:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Use Force?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And after he was so nice to us,\Nwell, I guess I can give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, what the heck are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't I be here, dumbass?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Franky house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about what\Nyou're doing, big bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.72,0:08:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you want to sail with the Straw Hats\Non that ship you built, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of stupid question is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.74,0:08:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, look at this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you do without me when you\Nlugheads can't even build a house right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We just got back from begging the\NStraw Hats to take you with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it'll be tough\Nwithout you, you gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.36,0:08:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But they want you to go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat crew needs a ship right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just turn them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me one reason why I should become\Na pirate after all we've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell just by looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you should have seen\Nyourself building that ship, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In all the time we've been together, I've\Nnever seen you smile like that even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You were like a new man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You were doing what you were meant to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.72,0:09:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew the Straw Hats were going to ask
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you to be their ship\Nright before they left,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you ran away, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But thanks to this, it\Ndoesn't matter anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Should've known.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it was only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you wanted, you\Ncouldn't stay with us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if you don't think\Nwe can make it without you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't want to drag you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you forgot already,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but you people were\Ndying in a ditch before I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.08,0:09:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,picked you up and made\Nyou what you are today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not here, you guys will\Nprobably starve to death in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy's on these!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He took his swim, breeze! Yes! Brilliant!\NDon't lose him! Put us some hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the undies and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my breeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.90,0:09:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only pair of those I got!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's scattered!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.64,0:09:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming out for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastards think our\Nudundies to beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take you down\Nstark naked if I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one of us needs to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta make it to Scrap\NIsland no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get those undies to Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep heading south and don't\Nlook back! We got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's, there's a pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankie's running wild and pantsless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.78,0:10:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your ass naked if I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.46,0:11:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even more indecent than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check out the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, get the children inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.74,0:11:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them see the pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.14,0:11:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest, Republican decency!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't give up the undies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.06,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yagora's ready to go! Good! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The back streets have\Nturned into a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.54,0:12:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass them to me! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.28,0:12:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see where they go next!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Little turd!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.86,0:12:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how'd you like this\Nship? It's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.90,0:12:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.81,0:12:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I think it's the\Ncoolest ship I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.06,0:12:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.97,0:12:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Iris and I have been chaining! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to that freak in jail!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight, it's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It was made from my super\Nblooper, it's after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I included all your requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I hooked it up with my\None-of-a-kind soldier dock system.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you had the chance to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just you wait, cause\Nit's gonna blow you away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the fish tank? If you catch\Nfish and dump them in the tank up top?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to see him\Nswim around in the room below.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an aquarium in a\Ndining room all in one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,whole crew can meet down\Nthere for a fancy dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know you'll always\Nhave fresh fish to pick from.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.38,0:13:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I promised it's the\Nbest damn ship a man can build
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,a ship of dreams for both of\Nus now give me back my dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're applying to smithereens!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop her! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you two for this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.96,0:14:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you trying to do?\NThe Franky family secret weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out! This\Nhas gone on long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.48,0:14:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are we supposed to\Nsend his undies that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.82,0:14:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky was flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven is punishing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.24,0:14:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, he could get up and go wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.50,0:14:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankie's naked! Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankie's naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.08,0:14:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This certainly took an interesting turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Vergo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.30,0:15:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.24,0:15:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you said, it's the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take good care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.98,0:15:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I had fun with you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hate to break it to you,\Nbut if you want your undies back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.44,0:15:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,then you're gonna have to join our crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to sue you for mental anguish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my briefs, Straw Hat. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Join my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you can keep\Nthose briefs, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing before the\Ncrashing waves, naked and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,proud you wouldn't ask a\Nlion to put on underwear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So why a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's showing a hip-haired\Nbottom loud and proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look. No try as I\Nmight, I can't unsee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,His determination is too great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a true man! A hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, he's obviously just a pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.50,0:16:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It might get a little rough,\Nbut shall I lend a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:16:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.24,0:17:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna crush him, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll tear him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gonna crush him to bits!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Like little oranges!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I still want him to be a man\Nwhen he joins us! Lay off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looking at him hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not fighting, but\NFrankie's in a lot of pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It almost sounds like someone\Nis choking a chicken to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's a pervert, but gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows pirates won't give up on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,treasure once they've\Nset their sights on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that we have this one\Nin our palms, so to speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let go without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't leave this\Nisland even if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the offer, really, but\Nit just ain't in the cards for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailing the seas would be great and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's still a lot of stuff\NI have left to take care of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.72,0:18:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I gave the ship to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I quit being a shipwright a long\Ntime ago, and I'm not going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.78,0:18:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last ship I'm\Nbuilding for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I only had one goal as a shipwright,\Nand now I've fulfilled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I made my ship of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.36,0:18:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say what you like,\Nbut I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the ship of dreams\Nthat you talked about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship of dreams? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And my dream doesn't end with blueprints\Neither, it's much bigger than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.14,0:18:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship that will sail with pride\Nand courage over uncharted waters,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:19:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,fighting its way through\Nevery battle over every wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And when it finally reaches\Nthe ends of the earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.96,0:19:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,then it will be my ship of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, I'll design that ship and\Nhammer the nails with my own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And when its crew sails, I'll\Njoin as their shipwright.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, I'll be there when\Nthe ship reaches its goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,At the ends of the world, even\Nif it's beat up and worn out,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.98,0:19:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that my ship will shine brighter\Nthan anything the ocean's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.61,0:19:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty awesome, right, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you ride that sucker\Ndown the Grand Line yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.22,0:19:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,then you'll surpass your master!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pirate blood of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.98,0:19:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A thug like you can't surpass Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.74,0:19:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? See?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're resorting to violence already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.03,0:19:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a man, you do it with gusto!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, my dream is different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what this is about at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not on this island because\Nof something you have to accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.36,0:20:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,because of guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day that Tom was\Ntaken away by the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you've blamed yourself for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But even before Tom left this\Nisland, he'd already forgiven you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He had shown you a new path.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For years, you've taken punks from the\Ninner city streets under your wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You've taught them to be dismantlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.90,0:20:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you've worked as bounty hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and you've protected this\Nisland from attacking pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All of this to atone for your sins,\Nto look after the city that Tom loved,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,that Tom was forced to leave behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, I don't imagine\Nmost people saw it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.74,0:21:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's not what\NI was doing, not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You loved shipbuilding and you gave it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You suppressed your dream\Nfor years and years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.98,0:21:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to do that\Nfor the rest of your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.86,0:21:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom has already forgiven you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already forgiven you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.66,0:21:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you do will change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.86,0:21:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This has gone on long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.22,0:21:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to forgive yourself, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.92,0:21:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Live, and follow the dream\Nyou've buried for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.90,0:22:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.46,0:22:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's luggage for your trip, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.19,0:22:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.22,0:22:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Franky family! Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.88,0:22:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.76,0:22:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.48,0:22:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't want to trick you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.04,0:22:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Really! We're sorry! We're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take any punishment you throw at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.98,0:22:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren't smart like you, but we\Nthought long and hard about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And even we know that it's the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.78,0:22:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Only way, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.00,0:22:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys aren't making\Nany sense to me You think
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.60,0:22:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm better off without\Nmy only pair of briefs,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.84,0:22:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.75,0:22:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I'll be better off\Nwith a bunch of pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.06,0:22:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't care what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.56,0:22:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my life, and I\Ndecide what's best for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.74,0:22:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the boss, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:23:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'd be happy living out the\Nlife my underlings planned for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You say you thought long and hard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.60,0:23:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd really thought about this, you\Nwouldn't have done it in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.72,0:23:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we're a pain, but is it wrong\Nfor us to worry about you even a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.90,0:23:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You turned our lives around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We just want what's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.04,0:23:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We just want our big bro to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.86,0:23:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.36,0:23:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Robin! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.96,0:23:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.50,0:23:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.70,0:23:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.86,0:23:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.14,0:23:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're not doing anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.62,0:24:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I only did it one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.70,0:24:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just being a big baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.00,0:24:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he has an excuse to cry all he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.02,0:24:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.93,0:24:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's faking it? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.98,0:24:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.47,0:24:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.44,0:24:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.76,0:24:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.22,0:24:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.30,0:24:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.80,0:24:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel your pain, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.72,0:24:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't got a clue how this feels!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.14,0:24:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well what do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.50,0:24:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Some freak job in his underpants.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.28,0:24:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you just stepped into\Nthe wrong part of town, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.78,0:24:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.02,0:24:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, from now on, the Backstreets of\NWater 7 will be ruled by me and only me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.06,0:24:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.26,0:25:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.38,0:25:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.16,0:25:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hit up the next place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.88,0:25:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.79,0:25:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy thinks he's too\Ngood for pants. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.02,0:25:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a drink together, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.50,0:25:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll show you the way to the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.20,0:25:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.96,0:25:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.40,0:25:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.66,0:25:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too early in the day, and you're\Ntoo young to be drinking like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.88,0:25:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.82,0:25:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're really thirsty, I can\Nshow you where to get some cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.68,0:25:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that sound good to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.98,0:25:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.32,0:25:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.64,0:25:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I need food.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.70,0:25:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who's hungry,\Nget up and come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.98,0:26:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.84,0:26:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning\Nof the Ferengi family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.42,0:26:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky! Franky! Franky! Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.36,0:26:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.27,0:26:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.19,0:26:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.10,0:26:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky! Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.56,0:26:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, are you really\Ngonna be okay without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.28,0:26:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You taught us how to work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.50,0:26:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make you proud\Nfor as long as we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.22,0:26:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Water Severn will never forget your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.94,0:26:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.22,0:26:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.34,0:26:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.62,0:26:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how far away you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.88,0:26:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll always be our boss\Nand you'll always be our bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.14,0:26:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.38,0:27:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.72,0:27:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.72,0:27:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.10,0:27:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We got bad news, Captain.\NThat stupid grandpa of
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.10,0:27:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,yours came back for us\Nloopy he's got a whole
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.30,0:27:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,bunch of Marines on the\Nother side of the island
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.30,0:27:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,getting ready to hunt\Nus down and take us out
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.06,0:27:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have time to figure that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.54,0:27:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just set sail what the damn it\NFranky put your underwear on
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.00,0:27:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Already. Geez
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.92,0:27:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.46,0:27:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,come
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.37,0:27:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,on get on my ship captain's orders your
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.58,0:27:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,ship already huh an amateur like you will\Nprobably sinker in less than a week you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.04,0:28:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,got the finest vessel on the sea and no\Nshipwright That's a real pity for the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.12,0:28:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.16,0:28:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't leave me much\Nchoice I got to take
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.28,0:28:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,care of my masterpiece\Nafter all so set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.28,0:28:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm joining the crew
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.64,0:28:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.76,0:28:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.72,0:28:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.54,0:28:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you teach me how to draw\Nup blueprints for one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.62,0:28:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I was a bad student, but\NI know I only caused you trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.26,0:28:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.17,0:28:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you guys hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.09,0:28:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Big news from Scrap Heave Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.70,0:28:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Tom's workers actually\Nfinish the Sea Train?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.62,0:29:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But all the same, thank\Nyou for looking after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.94,0:29:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You put together a fine team\Nof shipwrights, Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.66,0:29:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll take good care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.56,0:29:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I've been such\Na pain over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.48,0:29:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny Kokoro, Shorty and the Rabbit,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.22,0:29:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.14,0:29:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,all the lively townspeople,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.52,0:29:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,my little sisters,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sodom, Gomorrah, and all my bros,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.00,0:29:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you guys so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.20,0:30:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna super miss
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.46,0:30:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You all put on some pants.
